]}}]},"favorite_count":3617,"favorited":false,"full_text":"【高市総理・所信表明演説】\n「高市内閣の最優先課題は、「経済」の力で、国民の皆様の暮らしを守り、「希望ある未来」を切り拓くことです。\n働く皆様も、子育て世代の皆様も、御高齢の皆様も、地方で暮らす皆様も、「誰もが明日への希望を持てる日本」を創り上げてまいります。」 https://t.co/Vil1l9xags","id_str":"2107102786781598203","is_quote_status":false,"lang":"ja","possibly_sensitive":false,"possibly_sensitive_editable":true,"quote_count":63,"reply_count":279,"retweet_count":597,"retweeted":false,"user_id_str":"412940784"},"note_tweet":{"is_expandable":true,"note_tweet_results":{"result":{"entity_set":{"hashtags":[],"smarttags":[],"symbols":[],"timestamps":[],"urls":[{"display_url":"kantei.go.jp/jp/105/stateme…","expanded_url":"https://www.kantei.go.jp/jp/105/statement/2026/1005shoshinhyomei.html","indices":[190,213],"url":"https://t.co/VLOHmIUPX1"}],"user_mentions":[]},"id":"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIxMDcxMDI3ODY2NTE1OTA2NTY=","richtext":{"richtext_tags":[]},"text":"【高市総理・所信表明演説】\n「高市内閣の最優先課題は、「経済」の力で、国民の皆様の暮らしを守り、「希望ある未来」を切り拓くことです。\n働く皆様も、子育て世代の皆様も、御高齢の皆様も、地方で暮らす皆様も、「誰もが明日への希望を持てる日本」を創り上げてまいります。」\n\n本日（10月5日）行われた高市総理の所信表明演説の動画及びテキストは、官邸HPに掲載しています。\n▼詳細はこちら\nhttps://t.co/VLOHmIUPX1"}}},"rest_id":"2107102786781598203","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"64353","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}}},"entryId":"tweet-2107102786781598203","sortIndex":"2107238862232223744"},{"content":{"__typename":"TimelineTimelineItem","clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":{"injectionType":"OrganicListTweet"}},"element":"tweet"},"entryType":"TimelineTimelineItem","itemContent":{"__typename":"TimelineTweet","itemType":"TimelineTweet","tweetDisplayType":"Tweet","tweet_results":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","cashtag_attachments":[],"core":{"user_results":{"result":{"__typename":"User","action_counts":{"favorites_count":52},"affiliates_highlighted_label":{},"avatar":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1697575938316529664/Iob6ICh3_normal.jpg"},"banner":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/331514169/1655